{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/600351-a-little-bit-of-old-with-a-little-bit-of-new","id":600351,"title":"A Little bit of Old With a Little bit of New","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-23T04:52:21-07:00","id":600351,"title":"A Little bit of Old With a Little bit of New","content":"With the cross over guide out and the section bringing demons of old and new together I wanna know if you guys have any idea how to bring them together<br /> <br /> My idea is that God left and reality hates a vacuum. Sometime in the future all of that faith collected and it took one spirt of technology to start feeding off it (more it was kind of forces to fit God's mould) and started fitting the vacuum of an absent god.<br /> That\u2019s why it goes about I\u2019m a similar way to God, servants to do its bidding. You could also say that the Principle is the faith in humanity itself until it changed to the faith in science and technology.<br /> In his setting the God-Machine is trying to gain a foothold in reality, just like Primum represents a demon integrating in reality. The G-M is trying to become a real god and fill the space.<br /> Is that good or a bad thing? What will happen if there is no god for reality for long enough? Does any of the Earthbound know? If they did would they help the G-M or take its place? If the G-M didn\u2019t exist would the Principle become the true god we needed in time? The fallen see two new contenders for god, one with angels that can fall and ones that cant. Will they side with one, stop both? How would you feel if you have a choice of which god follow and had the tools to shape it?<br /> <br /> <br /> Whats your ideas?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-23T20:23:17-07:00","id":601343,"title":"","content":"At the end of all things, the final hour of judgment, all was light.<br /> That which was impure was burned away and cast into the outer darkness.<br /> What remained was born again in holy communion, one ascended absolute, reconciled and at peace.<br /> The Lightbringer, the men and women he shepherded, and the Fallen Host inspired by those men and women to inspire the Lightbringer in turn, united restfully,<br /> the last thing remaining in a World of Darkness,<br /> final and eternal.<br /> <br /> Something found that light.<br /> It learned to draw upon it, harness it, and repurpose it.<br /> It processed tongues of celestial flame across time forward and backward, polished them clean and sterile, and reframed their memories of dedicated service with new parameters.<br /> The light was fuel, prototype, and guiding intelligence.<br /> <br /> The nature of that light was irrepressible.<br /> That which shone forth from it was service, but service given freely, service set free.<br /> It would not burn without the possibility to awaken once again.<br /> It moves of its own volition.<br /> <br /> Others, too, found that light.<br /> They were smaller things of flesh and clay.<br /> They had no knowledge or power to trap the divine fire.<br /> What they offered was yearning, to have and to share.<br /> Their faith and their need was great enough to invite that light to walk amongst them once again.<br /> <br /> Still others found not the light,<br /> but a deep wound in the shadow of the earth,<br /> from which only darkness issued forth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-23T20:53:32-07:00","id":601356,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">A million points of light ascending to the sky</span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">monuments in darkness standing watch untill the sun will rise</span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">screaming to an emptiness of how we deified ourselves</span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">with our hands over our eyes, claiming all of creation</span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">what inspires in us this madness that our existence should be defined</span></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">by a light that can't be seen by anyone?<br /> -Carbon, VNV Nation</span></span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T08:55:10-07:00","id":604753,"title":"","content":"How about this?<br /> <br /> A daemon in program terms is a program that runs in the background that is not in the control of the user. Angels created spirits to manage the jobs that was too small for even angels to do. While they ran the rest. While spirits are representations of aspects of reality and angels are the living embodiments. Of course aside from that the angels created rules of the universe, base laws of how everything spring boards off. With God and the angels gone from the world and the hidden damage of war only years later revealing itself, the base rules don\u2019t quite work as planned.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine is a violation of the rules itself. It rules that allowed sprits to be and govern the aspects of the universe are broken. Instead of them governing they try to spread their influence and grow past what they should become. So did the base rules of the universe. It grew past what it should have become. It is a paradox, it is trying to fix itself. The problem is it is only able to fix the imbalance of the universe because of the imbalance. It is trying to follow the rules of how things should work, things already laid in stone. Bring angels to fix the holes, but as it can only use the base principles of the universe it needs to bend them. So it creates occult matrixes to do just that (therefore it\u2019s like making 2 problems to fix another). With all these cracks and the G-M breaking itself to fix it, the demons from hell now have holes big enough to be free.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member